# cs-steam-panel farm net

- **Never enable** Hyper-V `Default Switch` / `vEthernet (Default Switch)`.
- Farm guest net = only `csfarm-int` + `csfarm-nat`, and only while farming. Park `vEthernet (csfarm-int)` when user needs VPN.
- Never `Enable-NetAdapter` / `Disable-NetAdapter` by wildcard. Exact names only.
- Never touch Happ, wintun, WireGuard, or other VPN adapters.
- Control VM via Hyper-V console (Msvm keyboard/mouse), not host Steam/CS.
- Eyes are host vmconnect PrintWindow, not guest `/see`.
- One-shot scripts: `_tmp-` prefix, delete after task.
